  ---                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                         
  ### 1. Executive Engineering Assessment                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                         
  | Metric | Score | Assessment |                                                                                                        
  | :--- | :--- | :--- |                                                                                                                 
  | **Security** | 2/10 | **CRITICAL:** High risk of RCE; immediate remediation required. |                                              
